graph TD
    subgraph WritePath["Write Path (Memory & Disk)"]
        Client[Client Request] -->|1. Write| CL["CommitLog (Disk)<br/>Append-only log for durability"]
        Client -->|2. Write| MT["MemTable (RAM)<br/>In-memory sorted tree"]
        MT -->|3. Flush triggered by size/time| SST1["SSTable L0 (Disk)<br/>Immutable sorted string table"]
    end

    subgraph Compaction["Compaction Process (Disk)"]
        SST1 -->|Merge & Tombstone Removal| Compactor[Compaction Process]
        SST2[SSTable L0] -->|Merge| Compactor
        SST3[SSTable L0] -->|Merge| Compactor
        Compactor -->|Output New Segment| SST_L1["SSTable L1<br/>Larger, consolidated table"]
    end
 
